{"id": "17:34", "severity": "minor", "issues": [{"latin": "tamquam cervórum", "portuguese": "como os das corças", "problem": "cervorum is masculine/generic 'deer, stags'; 'corças' (hinds) follows the Hebrew 'ayyalot against the Latin.", "fix": "como os dos cervos"}]},
